
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Date with Yeji ♡</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing:border-box; }

body {
  margin:0;
  padding:20px 14px;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f5,#fff8fa,#fceaf2);
  color:#59434d;
}

.container {
  max-width:520px;
  margin:20px auto;
  padding:25px 20px;
  background:white;
  border-radius:25px;
  box-shadow:0 6px 25px #e9cbd6;
}

.page { display:none; }
.active { display:block; }

h1 {
  text-align:center;
  color:#e58ba9;
  font-size:27px;
}

h2 {
  color:#d7789b;
  text-align:center;
}

.subtitle {
  text-align:center;
  color:#a98a96;
  font-size:13px;
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

button {
  width:100%;
  padding:14px;
  border:none;
  border-radius:13px;
  background:#f3b4cb;
  color:white;
  font-size:15px;
  cursor:pointer;
  margin-top:10px;
}

button:hover { opacity:.85; }

.business-btn { background:#c9b8e8; }
.back { background:#eee;color:#777; }
.dark-btn { background:#9478b8; }
.danger { background:#e68b9d; }
.accept { background:#83b99a; }
.reject { background:#d99a9a; }

label {
  display:block;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin-top:12px;
}

input,select,textarea {
  width:100%;
  padding:12px;
  margin-top:7px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  border:1px solid #efd5df;
  border-radius:10px;
  font-size:14px;
  background:#fffdfd;
  color:#59434d;
}

textarea { resize:vertical; }

.other-input { display:none; }

.gear {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:flex-end;
  margin-top:25px;
}

.gear button {
  width:48px;
  height:48px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#f5e6ed;
  color:#ad7290;
  font-size:23px;
  padding:0;
}

.service-area {
  margin-top:25px;
  padding:15px;
  background:#fff2f6;
  border-radius:17px;
}

.service-card {
  background:white;
  padding:13px;
  border-radius:12px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  border:1px solid #f2dbe3;
}

.service-card label {
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
  margin:0;
}

.service-card input[type=checkbox],
.none-option input {
  width:18px;
  height:18px;
  margin:0;
  accent-color:#e58ba9;
}

.service-card p {
  font-size:12px;
  color:#9d8290;
}

.price {
  margin-left:auto;
  color:#d77b9d;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.payment-notice {
  display:none;
  padding:13px;
  background:#fce0eb;
  border-radius:12px;
  color:#bd6387;
  text-align:center;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.none-option {
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
  padding:12px;
}

/* 관리자 */

.admin-header {
  text-align:center;
  background:#f8eff8;
  padding:18px;
  border-radius:16px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.admin-menu {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:8px;
}

.admin-menu button {
  min-height:85px;
  background:#f7e5ed;
  color:#a65f80;
  font-size:14px;
  margin:0;
}

.admin-menu button span {
  display:block;
  font-size:24px;
  margin-bottom:7px;
}

.panel {
  background:#fff6f9;
  border-radius:15px;
  padding:14px;
  margin-top:15px;
}

.panel h3 { color:#c87596; }

.calendar-head {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
}

.calendar-head button {
  width:42px;
  margin:0;
  background:#f4dce6;
  color:#a65f80;
}

.calendar-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);
  gap:4px;
  margin-top:12px;
}

.weekday {
  text-align:center;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:bold;
  padding:8px 0;
  color:#a77d90;
}

.day {
  min-height:76px;
  border:1px solid #f2e1e8;
  border-radius:9px;
  background:white;
  padding:5px 2px;
  text-align:center;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-size:12px;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.day.today {
  background:#ffe0e3;
  border:2px solid #ed7b85;
  color:#d64d60;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.day.selected { border:2px solid #c58baa; }

.day.empty {
  background:transparent;
  border:none;
  cursor:default;
}

.day small {
  display:block;
  font-size:9px;
  margin-top:3px;
  overflow:hidden;
  line-height:1.3;
  word-break:break-all;
}

.day .count {
  color:#d45d86;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.day .holiday-label {
  color:#d45d75;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.day .birthday-label {
  color:#a45bbd;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.event {
  background:white;
  border:1px solid #f0dbe4;
  border-left:5px solid #f3a6c8;
  padding:12px;
  border-radius:12px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.event-title {
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#c56c90;
  font-size:15px;
}

.row-buttons {
  display:flex;
  gap:7px;
}

.row-buttons button {
  flex:1;
  font-size:12px;
  padding:10px 4px;
}

.request-card {
  background:white;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:14px;
  margin-bottom:13px;
  border:1px solid #eed9e2;
}

.status {
  display:inline-block;
  padding:5px 9px;
  border-radius:15px;
  font-size:11px;
  background:#f7e7ed;
  color:#ae6582;
}

.status.accepted { background:#e1f2e6;color:#47835c; }
.status.rejected { background:#f8e4e4;color:#b55b5b; }

.notice {
  background:#fff0f4;
  padding:12px;
  border-radius:10px;
  color:#a96a83;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.color-legend {
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:9px;
  margin:15px 0;
  font-size:11px;
  color:#8f7380;
}

.legend-item {
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:4px;
}

.legend-dot {
  width:10px;
  height:10px;
  border-radius:50%;
}

.special-day {
  padding:10px;
  border-radius:10px;
  margin-bottom:8px;
  background:#fff0f5;
  color:#ad6485;
  font-size:13px;
}

.hidden { display:none !important; }

.payment-total {
  background:#fce6ef;
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:16px;
  text-align:center;
  margin:15px 0;
}

.payment-total h2 {
  font-size:27px;
  margin:10px 0;
}

.payment-item {
  background:white;
  padding:15px;
  border:1px solid #eed9e2;
  border-radius:14px;
  margin:12px 0;
}

.payment-item .amount {
  font-size:20px;
  color:#d45d86;
  font-weight:bold;
}

@media(max-width:380px) {
  .container { padding:20px 13px; }
  .day { min-height:68px; }
  .day small { font-size:8px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<!-- 첫 화면 -->

<div id="home" class="page active">

<h1>데이트 신청하기  ♡</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
오늘은 예지와 어떤 특별한 시간을 보내고 싶나요? 🌷
</p>

<button onclick="showPage('personal')">
💗 개인 데이트 신청
</button>

<button class="business-btn"
onclick="showPage('business')">
✨ 비즈니스 신청
</button>

<div class="gear">
<button onclick="showPage('login')" title="관리자">⚙️</button>
</div>

</div>


<!-- 관리자 로그인 -->

<div id="login" class="page">

<h1>🔒 관리자 전용 🔒</h1>

<div class="admin-header">
<h2>🚨 예지 외 출입금지 🚨</h2>
<p> 예지만 접속할 수 있습니다.</p>
</div>

<label>관리자 비밀번호</label>

<input type="password"
id="adminPassword"
placeholder="비밀번호를 입력해 주세요."
onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')login()">

<button onclick="login()">로그인</button>

<button class="back" onclick="showPage('home')">
뒤로 가기
</button>

</div>


<!-- 개인 신청 -->

<div id="personal" class="page">

<h1>💗 개인 데이트 💗</h1>
<p class="subtitle">데이트를 신청해 보세요.</p>

<label>이름</label>
<input id="personalName" placeholder="이름을 입력해 주세요">

<label>날짜</label>
<input id="personalDate" placeholder="예: 11월 25일">

<label>시간</label>
<input type="time" id="personalTime">

<label>장소</label>
<select id="personalPlace"
onchange="showOther('personalPlace','personalPlaceOther')">
<option>서울</option>
<option>창원</option>
<option>대구</option>
<option>뉴욕</option>
<option>상하이</option>
