</div>
<div class="legend-item">
<span class="legend-dot" style="background:#b9a5e8"></span>보라
</div>
<div class="legend-item">
<span class="legend-dot" style="background:#91c5ed"></span>하늘색
</div>
<div class="legend-item">
<span class="legend-dot" style="background:#f5d27c"></span>노랑
</div>
<div class="legend-item">
<span class="legend-dot" style="background:#9dcfa9"></span>초록
</div>
<div class="legend-item">
<span class="legend-dot" style="background:#f2a18e"></span>주황
